            {
              "cardId": "c_1041_srt4",
              "name": "Echo of Sorrow",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Renoa Dirge Bullets, Discard and Draw Killing"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Renoa's main gimmick is her Dirge Bullets\nDirge Bullets are attack cards with Exhaust\nThey deal an Extra Attack on Discard\nDiscarding Dirge Bullets instead of Using them is more optimal\nThe main problem that Renoa comes to is actually her Dirge Bullets\nBecause if you discard Dirge Bullets they never exhaust\nIf they end up shuffling back into your deck\nYou could just end up killing your redraws and dying"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2-4-patch-notes",
      "title": {
        "en": "2/4 Patch notes"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Dirge Bullets got slight Discard damage buffs\nThey also now can deal Weakness Damage\nUnfortunately at the cost of Dimensional Cube having legs cut off"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
